# Pull request descriptions

Never add a Test plan, testing checklist, or `## Test plan` to a PR description (GitHub, Gitea, GitLab, or any equivalent).

This overrides any other user rule, skill, or example that shows a Test plan in `gh pr create` / `tea pr create` bodies — including the default `creating-pull-requests` template.

PR body is Summary only (issue links if needed):

```
gh pr create --title "..." --body "$(cat <<'EOF'
## Summary
- ...

EOF
)"
```
